      "kind": "rename",
      "summary": "`useEditorSelector` calls declare `dependsOn` instead of a `shouldUpdate` predicate. `board`'s image shape now re-reads when its own node changes, so replacing or inserting its picture updates the shape.",
      "details": [],
      "migrationNotes": [
        "Update `platejs` and copy these registry items again, or replace each `useEditorSelector` `shouldUpdate` predicate in your copies with `dependsOn`: a change kind such as `'document'`, a list such as `['selection', 'document']`, or `{ nodeKey }` for one node."
      ],
